Consuming the Module
  1. Open <host>\app\build.gradle
  2. Ensure you have the repositories configured, otherwise add them:

      String storageUrl = System.env.FLUTTER_STORAGE_BASE_URL ?: "https://storage.googleapis.com"
      repositories {
        maven {
            url '<LOCAL_ROOT>\apps\flutter_elitesync_module\build\host\outputs\repo'
        }
        maven {
            url "$storageUrl/download.flutter.io"
        }
      }

  3. Make the host app depend on the Flutter module:

    dependencies {
      releaseImplementation 'com.elitesync.flutter_elitesync_module:flutter_release:1.0'
    }

To learn more, visit https://flutter.dev/to/integrate-android-archive

